
>> Animal := Nkan tuntun.
Animal nigbati: ['tuntun'] ṣe: { <- ara-rẹ tuntun init.
}.

Animal nigbati: ['init'] ṣe: {
	tirẹ sound := ['?'].
	tirẹ legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal tuntun.
Dog nigbati: ['init'] ṣe: {
	ara-rẹ init.
	tirẹ sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal nigbati: ['ọrọ'] ṣe: { <- tirẹ legs ọrọ + tirẹ sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog tuntun.
Ijade kọ: poodle, ila-tuntun.

